  "combat": {
    "note": "Full rewrite of the old flat+scale damage/guard formulas. Every attack (basic, special, spell, Toxic Burst) is atkStat (str or mag, whichever the move is tagged with, raw value plus battle mods) times the move's own power rating (0.5-1.5, shown to the player x10 as 5-15). Speed is the same shape off agility: atkAgl x the move's speed rating, used only to resolve Dodge. Guard has no percentage roll any more -- Dodge is a speed contest, Block/Barrier are a flat score subtracted from the incoming hit. Both engines interpret this block; neither hardcodes these constants.",
    "dodgeDefenderRandMin": 0.75,
    "dodgeDefenderRandMax": 1.25,
    "guardRandMin": 0.25,
    "guardRandMax": 0.75,
    "barrierHealDivisor": 2,
    "parriedText": "Parried!",
    "absorbedText": "Absorbed!",
    "minigame": {
      "note": "Special timing needle 0-100. Red=fizzle 1x, yellow=connected 1.5x, green=perfect 2x.",
      "perfectMin": 45,
      "perfectMax": 55,
      "perfectMul": 2,
      "connectedMin": 30,
      "connectedMax": 70,
      "connectedMul": 1.5,
      "fizzleMul": 1,
      "needleSpeed": 110
    }
  },
  "growth": {
    "note": "Move unlocks and evolution. Basic is always known. At secondaryAt, non-shinies learn the crystal secondary (natureMoves); shinies learn shinyMove instead. At specialAt, the species special (and extra spells) unlock. Species with evolvesTo change form at evolveAt when they are a first stage, or at evolveAt2 when they are already an evolved form (the middle of a 3-stage line); the evolved form also learns hypeUp then. levelUpStats: 'flat' adds formulas.levelHp / levelStat per level; 'curve' adds what minting the same species one level higher would add (round(base x grow(lv)) - round(base x grow(lv-1)), never less than the flat amount), so a CryMon raised from a low level keeps pace with wild and trainer CryMon minted at that level. tools/balance_sim.py showed the flat rule leaves a kept-from-the-start team about 30% behind by Nero.",
    "secondaryAt": 5,
    "specialAt": 10,
    "evolveAt": 12,
    "evolveAt2": 22,
    "levelUpStats": "curve"
  },
